## Working rules

- Preserve explicit module, service, data, identity, event, and deployment boundaries.
- Record a decision before changing a public contract, introducing a new dependency, or changing a cross-cutting concern.
- Prefer the smallest change that keeps the chosen architecture coherent.
- Before production rollout, document availability, observability, backup/recovery, and ownership expectations.

## Update this guide when

Update this file when repository-wide boundaries or decision-making rules change. Put component diagrams, interface details, and operational specifics in the detailed architecture documents instead of duplicating them here.
